# 统一换行符：仓库里一律 LF，检出到工作区时按平台。
# 团队里只有 Windows 时最容易踩的坑就是「整文件都改了」其实只是 CRLF。
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows 构建脚本与批处理必须是 CRLF，否则 cmd 解析会出问题
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# 脚本类显式声明语言，方便 GitHub 高亮与 diff
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf

# 二进制：不要动，也不要试图 diff
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.so binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.anki2 binary

# 生成物不参与语言统计
pubspec.lock linguist-generated=true
*.lock linguist-generated=true
